Using the formula $OH^2 = 9R^2 - (a^2 + b^2 + c^2)$, substitute the given values $R = 7$ and $a^2 + b^2 + c^2 = 29$:
$$ OH^2 = 9(7)^2 - 29 = 9(49) - 29 = 441 - 29 = 412 $$
